{
  "id": "P05",
  "format": "posting-scenario/v1",
  "name": "Partial customer receipt of 6,000.0000 against a 10,000.0000 invoice; customer ledger 4,000.0000",
  "rules": ["CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_RECEIVED@1", "SALE_POSTED/service@1", "REPORT/trial-balance@1"],
  "source": "docs/posting-rules/customer-receipt.md",
  "governedBy": ["ADR-0005", "ADR-0011"],
  "executableFrom": "M3",
  "status": "Specified, hand-computed. Not yet executed: needs customers, invoices and receipts (M3). Step 2's errorDetail keys corrected to the contract's real shape (Accounting seat ruling, 2026-09-29, review of the M3-Q throwaway verify against M3-P @efb7e3f): `invoice` -> `invoiceNumber` (`invoiceId` omitted — an opaque runtime uuid, not a hand-computable figure). outstanding/requested unchanged.",
  "description": [
    "Step 1 posts P04's invoice (10000.0000 to CUST-A).",
    "",
    "Steps 2–5 are receipt rejections; none consumes a number.",
    "",
    "Step 6, the receipt, by hand:",
    "  Dr 1120 Bank                  6000.0000",
    "  Cr 1200 AR control [CUST-A]   6000.0000",
    "  Exactly two lines. The allocation (INV-A1, 6000.0000) is a subledger row, not a GL line.",
    "",
    "After step 6:",
    "  INV-A1 outstanding    = 10000.0000 − 6000.0000 = 4000.0000",
    "  CUST-A ledger         = 10000.0000 Dr − 6000.0000 Cr = 4000.0000 Dr",
    "  Invariant 9 (AR half) = GL 4000.0000 vs subledger 10000.0000 − 6000.0000 = 4000.0000; difference 0.0000",
    "  Trial balance: 1120 6000.0000 Dr; 1200 4000.0000 Dr; 4200 10000.0000 Cr;",
    "                 Σ Dr 10000.0000 = Σ Cr 10000.0000"
  ],
